  "question": {
    "text": "Let $\\mathrm{A}$ be the region enclosed by the parabola $y^2=2 x$ and the line $x=24$. Then the maximum area of the rectangle inscribed in the region $\\mathrm{A}$ is________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "128",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5Hm8bCZEI6J5LKZpnqqLo3UNAaPC2_MDWTnVf_j_3is.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & A=2\\left(24-\\frac{b^2}{2}\\right) \\cdot b \\\\ & \\frac{d A}{d b}=0 \\quad \\Rightarrow \\quad b=4 \\\\ & A=2(24-8) 4 \\\\ & =128\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
